    heading: "The Zoho integration briefs that arrive from each kind of UAE business",
    note: "We work remotely for companies anywhere in the UAE. These notes describe the briefs we see from each sector and emirate, not offices we keep or clients we claim.",
    cards: [
      { name: "Dubai trading and distribution", note: "Zoho Inventory half-configured, a price list maintained in a spreadsheet, and a website showing stock figures nobody trusts. The first job is almost always deciding who owns the number.", href: "/uae/trading-company-website-design/" },
      { name: "Business Bay consultancies", note: "CRM used properly by two partners and ignored by everyone else, with enquiries arriving on three personal WhatsApp numbers. Capture and attribution before any automation." },
      { name: "Sharjah and Ajman industrial suppliers", note: "Books kept carefully by an external accountant, quotes written in Word, and a reasonable ask to make the website's quote request become a real Books estimate.", href: "/uae/website-development-sharjah/" },
      { name: "Abu Dhabi professional services", note: "Approval chains that matter, an audit trail that has to survive a review, and a strong preference for one reconciliation report over five dashboards.", href: "/uae/seo-services-abu-dhabi/" },
      { name: "Free-zone ecommerce", note: "A Shopify or WooCommerce storefront, Books behind it, and a monthly argument about why the two revenue figures differ. Usually a reconciliation problem, not a sync problem.", href: "/uae/ecommerce-website-development/" },
      { name: "DMCC and JLT trading companies", note: "Multi-entity groups where one website serves two licences, and the integration has to know which entity is invoicing before it creates anything.", href: "/uae/website-development-dmcc/" },
      { name: "Clinics and medical practices", note: "The one sector where we often decline. Health data generated in the UAE carries an in-country storage requirement that must be resolved with the regulator before any CRM design.", href: "/uae/clinic-website-design/" },
      { name: "Real estate brokerages", note: "Portal leads, walk-ins and WhatsApp arriving faster than anyone can assign them, so duplicate handling and phone normalisation matter more than any feature.", href: "/uae/real-estate-website-design/" },
      { name: "Recruitment and manpower firms", note: "High-volume inbound candidates that must not land in the same pipeline as clients, which is a data-model decision made before the connector is written.", href: "/uae/recruitment-agency-website-uae/" },
      { name: "Logistics and freight", note: "Operational systems already in place and Zoho used for the commercial side, so the brief is a narrow bridge rather than a suite rollout.", href: "/uae/freight-forwarding-software/" },
      { name: "Education and training centres", note: "Enrolment forms, course catalogues and fee invoices, where the hard part is term dates and part payments rather than the integration itself.", href: "/uae/school-website-design-uae/" },
      { name: "Hospitality and tours", note: "Deposits taken now for a supply date later, which makes date-of-supply handling the first thing to settle with the accountant.", href: "/uae/tour-booking-website-design/" },
    ],
